.DS_Store
*.zip
*.jpg
*.jpeg
tag.sh
.cursor/

# PMD SpriteBot dumps (`*-Anim.png`, offsets, shadows). Those strips wedge
# the voxel pass if a fight loads them. Unpack locally, then bake.
*.png
# Runtime pad kits only (32px, 4-facing). `follower_005.png`, optional
# `follower_005_normal.png`, or a hand-drawn `CHARMELEON.png` at this folder.
!assets/followers/follower_*.png
!assets/followers/*.png
# Gen 1 battle faces at the dex root. Form / shiny folders, later gens,
# and PMD flip frames (`Emotion^.png`) stay local — `^` in a zip name
# makes the Gen1Recomp installer refuse the archive.
!assets/portrait/00[0-9][0-9]/*.png
!assets/portrait/01[0-4][0-9]/*.png
!assets/portrait/015[01]/*.png
assets/portrait/**/*^.png

# Baker
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
.venv/
venv/
